oxed (0.1.1~dev1) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * Milestone 001: specify the final main.ml lifecycle using Lwt,
    nested Lwt.finalize cleanup, and the App event loop.
  * Resolve unbound modules through .mli contracts: App, Terminal,
    Editor, Workspace, Ed, Syntax, and Language. Temporarily use
    modules_without_implementation in dune.
