    Language.stop : t -> unit Lwt.t; supply both Lwt.finalize callbacks.
  * Add matching .ml implementations, initially with explicit TODO
    failures; remove modules_without_implementation after linking.
  * Replace unused event constructor Pending with unit (warning 37).
  * Commands: `dune build`; inspect diagnostic; add smallest contract;
    rebuild. The linked bootstrap eventually built successfully.
  * Remaining: most editor behavior is still intentionally unimplemented.

